cff-version: 2.0.1
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "API-Pop: An application programming interface for integrating case reports with population denominators and geographic data"
abstract: "API-Pop is an R/Shiny tool that uses RapidCaseReport exports and adds population context after data collection. It provides flexible filtering (symptoms, onset date, diagnosis, age range, location) and exports filtered case lists and weekly area-based summaries (cases + population) for geospatial analysis, CUSUM alerting, and dashboard integration."
